.TH PROPS:VERIFY 1 "SPP CLI" "Version 1.0" "SPP Manual"
.SH NAME
spp-props-verify \- Verifies workspace code integrity against cryptographic checksums and HMAC signatures in directory manifests (__spp_file_props.yml).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php props:verify
[\-\-app=app_name]
[\-\-dir=directory_path]
[\-\-key=secret_key]
[\-\-strict]
[\-\-verbose]
[\-\-json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Performs cryptographic code integrity checks by comparing SHA-256 file hashes and HMAC-SHA256 signatures against registered entries in __spp_file_props.yml. Flags tampered, missing, untracked, and corrupt files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-app=<app_name>
(Optional) Scopes audit to src/<app_name>.
.TP
.B \-\-dir=<directory_path>
(Optional) Scopes audit to a specific directory.
.TP
.B \-\-key=<secret_key>
(Optional) Secret key to verify HMAC-SHA256 signatures.
.TP
.B \-\-strict
(Optional) Enables strict mode flagging missing checksums and untracked files.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose, \-v
(Optional) Prints all untracked files without truncation.
.TP
.B \-\-json
(Optional) Formats audit results as JSON.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Traverses manifests, recalculates SHA-256 digests, performs constant-time hash comparisons with hash_equals(), and reports detailed findings.
